# CODEOWNERS — rename to CODEOWNERS (no .sample) to activate.
#
# Listed people are requested for review automatically when matching files
# change. This is how you guarantee the 48-hour SLA actually has an owner
# instead of "someone will look at it".
#
# Handles must be org members with write access, or the rule is silently ignored.

# Everything, as a fallback
*                       @FILL-domain-lead

# Anything that touches CI or contribution policy stays with OS & DevX
/.github/               @FILL-osdevx-lead
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @FILL-osdevx-lead
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md     @FILL-osdevx-lead

# Security-relevant files get a second pair of eyes
/SECURITY.md            @FILL-digital-defence-lead
/.gitleaks.toml         @FILL-digital-defence-lead

# Docs
/docs/                  @FILL-editorial-lead
/README.md              @FILL-editorial-lead
